msgid "lang-check supports inline comment directives that control checking behavior within specific regions of a document. Directives are placed inside comments using any of the four supported comment formats."
msgstr "lang-check supports inline comment directives that control checking behavior within specific regions of a document. Directives are placed inside comments using any of the four supported comment formats."

